## Completion protocol (this run has no human)
Nobody can answer questions or approve prompts. Do not ask interactively. When you are done, write the JSON file `.kodama-result.json` in the workspace root: {"outcome":"completed"|"needs_input"|"failed","summary":"…","question":"…","reason":"…","conformance":{"requirements":[…],"checks":[{"id":"…","outcome":"passed|failed|not_run","evidence":"…"}],"deviations":[{"requirement":"…","reason":"…"}]}}. Use needs_input with a question when business input is missing, and report any material conflict with the baseline under conformance.deviations instead of inventing a different design. A prose reply is not a result: without a valid result file the step fails.
